&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Pricing &amp;amp; Yield Management professional to join our team and drive strategic decisions that directly impact business outcomes. In this role, you&#39;ll be at the intersection of sales, product, and finance teams, translating data into pricing strategies that optimize revenue while balancing scale and growth. You&#39;ll split your time between strategic operational decisions and building the foundations of new monetization approaches, specifically a biddable auction environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
