&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Program Manager with deep Salesforce expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as the &lt;strong&gt;connective tissue across our commercial and product ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;. This individual will operate at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;Sales, Customer Success, Finance, Product, and Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring that systems, processes, and teams remain tightly aligned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
